+- Expand [[a#0, b#1, 0L], [a#0, CAST(NULL AS STRING), 1L], [CAST(NULL AS INT), b#1, 2L], [CAST(NULL AS INT), CAST(NULL AS STRING), 3L]], [a#5, b#6, spark_grouping_id#3]
   +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1]
